summary: 'Bug 601047 - Deadlock while using stack tracer(ftrace)'
description: |
    This is a ftrace regression testcase for bz601047.

    For RHEL6.2, kernel 2.6.32-192.el6, only x86_64 system has
    /proc/sys/kernel/stack_tracer_enabled, because on x86_64 has
    CONFIG_STACK_TRACER been set in kernel config.
contact: Yanzhen Ren<yren@redhat.com>
test: ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - type: file
    pattern:
     - /general/ftrace/include
duration: 30m
adjust+:
  - duration: 40m
    when: hw_target == rcar_s4
tier: 2
tag: [tier2]
link:
  - relates: https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=601047
extra-summary: /kernel/general/ftrace/regression/601047-deadlock
extra-task: /kernel/general/ftrace/regression/601047-deadlock
id: f203824a-f480-477f-9bb0-a6516272a458
